        "label": "名称",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "status",
        "label": "状态",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "可用",
            "value": "active"
          },
          {
            "label": "停用",
            "value": "disabled"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "remark",
        "label": "备注",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false,
        "inTable": false,
        "inForm": true
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "inTable 铰链：初版 NL **显式**说「备注只在弹窗里填，列表不显示」，模型会把 inTable 置 false（结构性 miss）；纠正后才翻成 true。"
}
